A carve of lines or units takes any range, not only one within the invoked capability.
It would hand out lines or units the carver does not hold, or ones there are not;
a capability to lines or units names ones there are, within its parent's.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work test smp-test qemu-replay
Report: time capability outside the units there are

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -471,9 +471,6 @@ static int carve_range(struct thread *t, uint32_t slot, const struct cap *cap, c
 {
     uint32_t off = arg[1];
     uint32_t len = arg[2];
-    if (len == 0 || off > cap->b || len > cap->b - off) {
-        return KERR_INVALID_ARG;
-    }
     struct cap sub = { .type = cap->type, .rights = cap->rights, .a = cap->a + off, .b = len };
     return cap_store(thread_table(t), arg[3], &sub, slot_node(t, slot));
 }
